0..78 Comment "//! Each rule\'s cell counts how many times its right side writes each hole its"
79..159 Comment "//! left side binds: the hole\'s Lipschitz constant under the step, the factor by"
160..235 Comment "//! which one step can stretch a distance between two instances of the hole"
236..322 Comment "//! [Gavazzo-2022-quantitative_metric_rewriting_abstract_nonexpansive_graded_systems],"
323..403 Comment "//! § 8.2. `gandr cells` reports the counts of every cell. `mirror` writes each"
404..483 Comment "//! subshrub once and is strictly linear; `left` drops `r`, a constant of zero;"
484..558 Comment "//! `twice` and `thrice` write `t` two and three times, so their steps are"
559..611 Comment "//! duplicating. A count is reported, never refused."
612..615 Comment "//!"
616..632 Comment "//! - see: #2788"
633..727 Comment "//! - cites: [Gavazzo-2022-quantitative_metric_rewriting_abstract_nonexpansive_graded_systems]"
728..731 Comment "//!"
732..955 Comment "//! [Gavazzo-2022-quantitative_metric_rewriting_abstract_nonexpansive_graded_systems]: https://arxiv.org/abs/2206.13610 \"Gavazzo and Di Florio, Quantitative and Metric Rewriting: Abstract, Non-Expansive, and Graded Systems\""
